OL,4,G1600FComposer of the Week: Monteverdi
OL,5,     GKate Molleson explores
OL,6,     GMonteverdi's move to Mantua,
OL,7,     Gwhere his madrigals grow bolder
OL,8,     Gand his ideas challenge musical
OL,9,     Gconvention.
